<title>USA: Trident Microsystems sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Trident Microsystems sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident Microsystems Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a plan to set aside $9 million to buy back up to 600,000 shares of its common stock over the next six months.</p>
</text>
